{"text": "It was not until midnight that only the last stone remained, and from behind the wall came a low, sad laugh. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Ha, ha, a very good joke indeed, and we will laugh about it later over our wine, said the voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But is it not getting late, and will the others not be waiting for us at home, Let us be gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yes, I answered as I lifted the last heavy stone, let us be gone. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the love of God, Montresor, he cried, and I repeated his words, Yes, for the love of God. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I called his name twice, but there was no answer except the soft ringing of the bells on his cap. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> My heart grew sick, but I told myself that it was only because of the dampness of the vaults. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I hurried to put the last stone in place, and against the new wall I piled up the old bones again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For half a century, no living person has disturbed those bones, and they still keep my secret today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And so I end my story with a short Latin prayer, In pace requiescat, which means May he rest in peace.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "m", "i", "d", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "s", "t", "o", "n", "e", " ", "r", "e", "m", "a", "i", "n", "e", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "r", "o", "m", " ", "b", "e", "h", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "l", "l", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "w", ",", " ", "s", "a", "d", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "a", ",", " ", "h", "a", ",", " ", "a", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "j", "o", "k", "e", " ", "i", 